    "home-images": {
      "x": 2510,
      "y": 1000,
      "w": 460,
      "fill": "blue",
      "page": "home",
      "text": "Imagery: the hero, the dance and the three-generations scenes are original flat illustrations drawn from your photos (no real person is depicted). The Faktanglung photo is used raw only as the modal background, under a light layer, as in Bitsky's modals."
    },
